Fabric. Say it with me. Fabric!

11
00:01:00.061 --> 00:01:02.844
Fit. Say it with me. Fit!

12
00:01:06.331 --> 00:01:09.964
Comfortable. Say it with me. Comfortable!

13
00:01:13.486 --> 00:01:17.119
Fashionable. Say it with me. Fashionable!

14
00:01:20.594 --> 00:01:24.777
