Style. Say it with me. Style!

17
00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:51.017
Grammar time! Adjective order. Listen. a comfortable blue hoodie; a trendy black jacket

18
00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:56.414
Your turn. Say it with me. a comfortable blue hoodie; a trendy black jacket

19
00:02:01.081 --> 00:02:08.675
I like a casual style with comfortable sneakers and a hoodie. My sister prefers trendy, fashionable outfits for school.

20
00:02:08.725 --> 00:02:10.153
I like this story!

21
00:02:11.401 --> 00:02:16.564
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:16.614 --> 00:02:17.764
Casual!

23
00:02:18.779 --> 00:02:23.961
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:24.011 --> 00:02:25.076
Fit!

25
00:02:25.795 --> 00:02:33.494
Think and answer. Describe your typical outfit for school.

26
00:02:33.544 --> 00:02:34.694
Great answer!

27
